<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<header class="nav">
  <div class="nav-in glass">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo"><img src="/assets/logo.webp" alt="ProtectHealth" width="150" height="38" /></a>
    <span class="kicker-chip">Official Paychex Partner</span>
    <a class="btn btn-sm" href="#ask">Book a strategy call</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main" tabindex="-1">

  <!-- ================================================================ HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="section-label">Nevada employers · six or more people</p>
        <h1>Your payroll is a tax&nbsp;asset you are <span class="u">not claiming.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">The Nevada retirement mandate, the tip credit that just got bigger, the payroll tax you're paying on pre-tax premiums, and the federal credits that cover most of a new plan. Twenty minutes. No pitch.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn" href="#ask">Book a strategy call</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#doors">See the four doors</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-proof">★★★★★ 4.9 · 703+ Google reviews · Insurance nerds, not tax professionals</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-art glass-frame">
        <img src={IMG["hero"]} alt="" width="1600" height="900" loading="eager" />
        <div class="hero-chip glass"><span class="hero-chip-n">$24,500</span><span class="hero-chip-l">401(k) employee limit, 2026</span></div>
        <div class="hero-chip hero-chip-2 glass"><span class="hero-chip-n">100%</span><span class="hero-chip-l">of startup costs, up to $5,000/yr</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= MECHANISM -->
  <section class="band" id="doors">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Four doors, one story</p>
      <h2>The reason you're not claiming it is structure, not eligibility.</h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card card-door spot reveal">
          <div class="card-img"><img src={IMG["d1"]} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><p class="card-n">01</p>
          <h3>Nevada requires a retirement route.</h3>
          <p>Most owners picked the state program. It's a Roth IRA the employee owns, and you're not permitted to put a dollar in. For 2026 it caps at $7,500. A 401(k) caps at $24,500 before your match.</p>
          <a href="/blog-post/nevada-retirement-plan-mandate">The mandate, explained</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card-door spot reveal">
          <div class="card-img"><img src={IMG["d2"]} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><p class="card-n">02</p>
          <h3>The tip credit reached salons in 2025.</h3>
          <p>For thirty years it was a restaurant thing. For tax years beginning after December 31, 2024 it reaches barbering, hair, nails, esthetics and spa. Same one-page form. Almost nobody has filed it.</p>
          <a href="/blog-post/tipped-payroll-mistakes-las-vegas">How the credit works</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card-door spot reveal">
          <div class="card-img"><img src={IMG["d3"]} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><p class="card-n">03</p>
          <h3>Pre-tax premiums cut your payroll tax too.</h3>
          <p>Under a Section 125 plan, the employer's own FICA and FUTA fall with the employee's taxable wages. Most small employers deduct after tax because nobody set up the document.</p>
          <a href="/blog-post/section-125-plan-employer-payroll-tax-savings">What it's worth at 2026 rates</a>
        </article>
        <article class="card card-door spot reveal">
          <div class="card-img"><img src={IMG["d4"]} alt="" loading="lazy" /></div><p class="card-n">04</p>
          <h3>The federal credits cover most of a new plan.</h3>
          <p>100% of qualified startup costs up to $5,000 a year for three years for employers with 50 or fewer people, plus up to $1,000 per employee for contributions and $500 a year for auto-enrollment.</p>
          <a href="/blog-post/small-business-retirement-plan-tax-credits">The credits and who qualifies</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================ PROOF -->
  <section class="band band-soft">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">What the research says</p>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat reveal"><span class="num">16%</span><span class="lbl">more likely to report increased profitability with a PEO</span><span class="src">NAPEO</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal"><span class="num">27%</span><span class="lbl">savings on HR administration costs</span><span class="src">NAPEO</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal"><span class="num">50%</span><span class="lbl">more likely to stay in business</span><span class="src">NAPEO</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal"><span class="num">$1,775</span><span class="lbl">average savings per employee per year</span><span class="src">U.S. Dept. of Labor, 2024</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================= PROOF 2 -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Real reviews, word for word</p>
      <h2>4.9 stars. 703+ Google reviews. People who had the conversation.</h2>
      <div class="rv">
        <blockquote class="card spot reveal"><p>"Thank you, Jeff Barton and ProtectHealth! Felt like family with the best service! Helped us navigate through - making it as easy as possible. The VERY best!"</p><cite>Rachel Wren · September 2025</cite></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="card spot reveal"><p>"Brian was amazing and took the time to walk me through everything step by step and answer any questions I had."</p><cite>Katie Rose Matthews · January 2026</cite></blockquote>
        <blockquote class="card spot reveal"><p>"Lorraine Castillo was my agent, very professional and detailed. Great Agent, I will be recommending her services."</p><cite>Keith Irby · September 2025</cite></blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ================================================================== ASK -->
  <section class="band" id="ask">
    <div class="wrap wrap-2">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Twenty minutes, no pitch</p>
        <h2>Tell us four things. We'll tell you which doors are open.</h2>
        <p class="lede">A broker calls you back within the hour during business hours. You leave knowing what applies, what doesn't, and what to ask your CPA. If nothing applies, we'll say that too.</p>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Network and plan options checked against your actual payroll</li>
          <li>Retirement mandate status confirmed</li>
          <li>Tip credit and Section 125 eligibility mapped</li>
          <li>Payroll and HR handed to Paychex only if you want it</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <form class="lead glass-form" id="lead" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" name="formId" value="employers" />
        <input type="hidden" name="form" value="employers" />
        <input type="hidden" name="page" value={PAGE} />
        <input type="hidden" name="campaign" value="paychex" />
        <input type="hidden" name="utm" id="utm" value="" />
        <div class="row">
          <label>First name<input name="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" required /></label>
          <label>Last name<input name="lastName" autocomplete="family-name" required /></label>
        </div>
        <label>Business<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" required /></label>
        <div class="row">
          <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required /></label>
          <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required /></label>
        </div>
        <label>Industry
          <select name="industry" required>
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>Restaurant, bar or hospitality</option>
            <option>Salon, barbershop, nails or spa</option>
            <option>Construction or trades</option>
            <option>Professional services</option>
            <option>Medical or dental practice</option>
            <option>Retail</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <div class="row">
          <label>Employees
            <select name="employees" required>
              <option value="">Choose</option>
              <option>1 to 5</option><option>6 to 10</option><option>11 to 25</option><option>26 to 50</option><option>51 to 100</option><option>100+</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label>Payroll today
            <select name="payroll">
              <option value="">Choose</option>
              <option>In-house</option><option>Bookkeeper or CPA</option><option>Paychex</option><option>ADP</option><option>Gusto</option><option>QuickBooks</option><option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>
        <label>Biggest friction right now
          <select name="friction" required>
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>Benefits I can't afford to offer</option>
            <option>The Nevada retirement mandate</option>
            <option>Payroll and HR taking too much time</option>
            <option>Tax credits I might be missing</option>
            <option>Hiring and keeping people</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="btn btn-wide" type="submit">Book my strategy call</button>
        <p class="fine">No cost. No obligation. We're insurance professionals, not tax professionals; anything tax-related goes to your CPA before you act.</p>
        <p class="err" role="alert" id="lead-err"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================ SPLIT CTA -->
  <section class="band band-soft">
    <div class="wrap wrap-2 split">
      <div class="card spot">
        <h3>Talk to a ProtectHealth broker</h3>
        <p>Benefits, the retirement mandate, tip credit and Section 125 eligibility. Start with the form above or call.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="tel:+18002408185" data-ev="cta_benefits_click">Call 800-240-8185</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card spot card-px">
        <h3>Already know you want payroll or HR?</h3>
        <p>Go straight to Paychex. Fred Simonds, Strategic Business Consultant, is our named contact.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-px" href={PAYCHEX_REFERRAL} data-ev="cta_paychex_click" rel="noopener">Request Paychex information</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====================================================== PAYCHEX, VERBATIM -->
  <section class="band px-band">
    <div class="wrap wrap-2">
      <div>
        <img class="px-mark" src="/assets/partners/paychex-lockup.png" alt="Paychex. HR, Payroll, Benefits, Insurance." width="220" height="60" />
        <h2 class="px-h2">Save Time and Money on HR Tasks</h2>
        <h3 class="px-h3">Simplify HR with Paychex HR PEO</h3>
        <p>A Professional Employer Organization (PEO) helps make it easier for you to manage HR, benefits, payroll, and compliance — so you can focus your time and budget on what matters most to your business.</p>
        <p>The all-in-one Paychex HR PEO can help you:</p>
        <ul class="px-list">
          <li>Streamline payroll and employee management</li>
          <li>Offer world-class employee benefits</li>
          <li>Reduce risk and keep up with compliance</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-px" href={PAYCHEX_REFERRAL} data-ev="cta_paychex_click" rel="noopener">Get Started</a>
      </div>
      <div class="px-why">
        <h3 class="px-h3">Why You Should Choose Paychex</h3>
        <dl>
          <dt>Customized Solutions</dt><dd>Find the right PEO solution for your specific business needs and size with the ability to grow with you.</dd>
          <dt>Transparent Pricing</dt><dd>Itemized invoices and clear cost breakouts help you determine the true impact of your return on investment.</dd>
          <dt>Easy Setup</dt><dd>Sign-up and setup are easy with our online portal and support that's ready to help if you need it.</dd>
          <dt>Dedicated Support</dt><dd>Work with a highly trained HR professional who can guide you through your HR issues with help from your payroll specialist, overall client advocate, and on-demand service.</dd>
          <dt>Experience You Can Trust</dt><dd>Paychex has helped businesses succeed for more than 50 years and supports millions of worksite employees for customers across the country.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================= LIBRARY -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="section-label">Read before you call, if you want</p>
      <h2>The employer-tax library.</h2>
      <div class="lib">
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/blog-post/nevada-retirement-plan-mandate"><span>Guide</span>Nevada's Retirement Plan Mandate: What Employers With Six Or More People Must Do</a>
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/blog-post/small-business-retirement-plan-tax-credits"><span>Guide</span>The Federal Credits That Pay For A Small Business Retirement Plan</a>
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/blog-post/section-125-plan-employer-payroll-tax-savings"><span>Guide</span>How A Section 125 Plan Cuts An Employer's Payroll Tax Bill</a>
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/qa/is-there-a-penalty-for-not-registering-for-nevada-nest"><span>Q&amp;A</span>Is there a penalty for not registering for Nevada NEST?</a>
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/qa/is-the-work-opportunity-tax-credit-still-available"><span>Q&amp;A</span>Is the Work Opportunity Tax Credit still available?</a>
        <a class="lib-i spot" href="/paychex"><span>Hub</span>Everything on payroll, retirement and credits for Nevada employers</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="lockup">
      <img src="/assets/logo.webp" alt="ProtectHealth" width="170" height="43" />
      <img src="/assets/partners/paychex-lockup.png" alt="Paychex. HR, Payroll, Benefits, Insurance." width="176" height="48" />
    </div>
    <p class="legal">Professional employer organization (PEO) services provided by Paychex Business Solutions, LLC (Florida employee leasing license GL7), Oasis Outsourcing, LLC (Florida employee leasing license GL42), and their affiliates, which are licensed or registered to provide PEO services where required by law. © 2026 Paychex, Inc. All Rights Reserved. | 173193 03/10/2026</p>
